\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 H-Run
\f1\b0\fs24 \

\f0\b Description\

\f1\b0 H-Run is a dynamic and engaging game developed with SwiftUI. The game involves navigating a horse through various obstacles, collecting power-ups, and scoring points.The game includes difficulty levels, unique maps and immersive sound effects.\
 
\f0\b \
Features\
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Two difficulty levels: 
\f1\b0 Easy (3 lives) and Hard (1 live).\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Gameplay mechanics: 
\f1\b0 Obstacle avoidance, power-ups (star and shield), scoring and game over conditions.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Maps: 
\f1\b0 Select between three maps: Dessert, Under Water and Space.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Sound effects: 
\f1\b0 Include sound for star, shield, horse collision and horse running.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f0\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Dynamic backgrounds: 
\f1\b0 Different backgrounds for each map.\
\pard\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

