\cf0 Game Mechanics\
\pard\tx220\tx720\tx1440\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\tx5040\tx5760\tx6480\tx7200\tx7920\tx8640\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Obstacle avoidance:
\f1\b0  avoid obstacles to not lose lives.
\f0\b \
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Power-ups: 
\f1\b0 collect star for double scoring and shield for protection.
\f0\b \
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Scoring: 
\f1\b0 points are given according to the distance covered and star collected (for double points).
\f0\b \
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Cooldown mechanism: 
\f1\b0 prevents losing all lives immediately upon hitting obstacles.	
